From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:16:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t7001-air2: Enable SmartIO

Start the SmartIO coprocessor, the DMA engine of the speaker link. Its
firmware is staged from the kernelcache (apple/t7000-smartio.bin).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-air2.dtsi | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-air2.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-air2.dtsi
index 613dd1bea..1d33fef01 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-air2.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-air2.dtsi
@@ -193,6 +193,11 @@ &i2c1 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+/* SmartIO: the DMA engine of every MCA and of spi1 */
+&sio {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &serial5 {
 	pinctrl-0 = <&uart5_pins>;
 	pinctrl-names = "default";
-- 
2.56.0

